The penalty for killing a pet in this way is -15 to alignment and -1
to luck, but it does not anger your god.  The alignment penalty is
probably not serious this late in the game (another post in this
thread has explained how to check your alignment).

Bad luck can be a more serious problem.  Make sure you have a blessed
luckstone so that good luck sticks and bad luck doesn't.  To increase
your luck, sacrifice on a coaligned altar or throw valuable gems at a
coaligned unicorn.

